Breadcrumbs and Back link | See Interaction model. | Low | Back link. **For owner** (owner-decisions.md #13).
Bars | DS `bars.md`: "Footer: one line under every screen" with the shortcut entry; HeroUI `Navbar` is "not app chrome". The spec has no footer, builds AppShell from Listbox and Dropdown, and the DrawingToolbar from "Button group, Tooltip". | Low. Roving focus and More Actions overflow are not specified for the DrawingToolbar. | Build the toolbar on React Aria `Toolbar` (one Tab stop, arrows); record "no footer" as an exception. Toolbar: **Fixed in spec.** DrawingToolbar on React Aria Toolbar (screens.md inventory). No footer: **For owner** (owner-decisions.md #13).
